<section class="mf-room__band" id="guide" aria-labelledby="mf-guide-title"><div class="mf-room__shell">
  <div class="mf-room__head"><div><p class="mf-room__eyebrow mf-room__eyebrow--gold">The field guide</p><h2 id="mf-guide-title">Before you choose</h2></div><p>The questions to settle before ordering.</p></div>
  <ol class="mf-room__guide"><li><b>01</b>Size the space first. A typical build runs $3,300 to $13,000 for a terrace up to 100 sq ft and $13,200 to $52,000 for an estate of about 400 sq ft, before the grill and heaters.</li><li><b>02</b>Choose how you cook before you choose the grill: gas for speed, a hybrid like the Kalamazoo for wood, charcoal and gas, or a Wi-Fi pellet grill for long smokes.</li><li><b>03</b>Plan heat with the electrician. The Bromic 53-inch electric heater is 4,500 W on 240 V; the Platinum 500 runs on propane and needs no electrician.</li><li><b>04</b>Luxury builds with premium grills and stone run to $40,000 and beyond, so budget the island as well as the grill.</li><li><b>05</b>Prices change. Every price here names its merchant and the day it was checked; check again before you order.</li></ol>
</div></section>
<section class="mf-room__band mf-site__approach" id="approach" aria-labelledby="mf-approach-title"><div class="mf-room__shell">
  <div class="mf-room__head"><div><p class="mf-room__eyebrow mf-room__eyebrow--gold">Our approach</p><h2 id="mf-approach-title">Only what we can stand behind.</h2></div><p>The Outdoor Estate is a Many Faces Online store. We research from manufacturer and retailer information, not hands-on testing.</p></div>
  <ul class="mf-room__guide"><li><b>Chosen for build quality</b>Picked for how they work together, not for commission.</li><li><b>Prices you can check</b>Each card says where and when we checked the price.</li><li><b>No partner yet</b>None of these brands is a partner; links earn nothing yet.</li><li><b>How we are paid</b>We may earn a commission if you buy through a merchant link. The merchant sets the price, delivery and returns; a commission never changes what we list.</li></ul>
  <p class="mf-room__note-small">Prices are as listed by each merchant on the date shown and can change. No checkout happens on this site.</p>
</div></section>
